Note on underlying methodology: the filter, balance, and calibrate workflow
follows Yield Editor, from USDA-ARS in Columbia, Missouri, and the method
in Sudduth and Drummond, 2007. The flow-delay search is this project's
implementation of PCDI, from Lee, Sudduth, Drummond, and Chung, 2012.
The method is theirs. The code here is ours. This AGPLv3 license covers
this independent reimplementation only. This project is not a USDA product
and is not endorsed by USDA. USDA's own download terms apply to USDA's
software, not to this page:
https://www.ars.usda.gov/research/software/download/?softwareid=370&modecode=50-70-10-00

